<title>UK: RUGBY LEAGUE-SUPER LEAGUE WORLD CHALLENGE RESULTS. [CORRECTED 23:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-SUPER LEAGUE WORLD CHALLENGE RESULTS. [CORRECTED 23:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Super League World</p>
<p>Club Challenge rugby league matches played at the weekend:</p>
<p>Played Sunday:</p>
<p> Brisbane Broncos (Australia)  76  Halifax (England)   0</p>
<p> Canberra (Australia)	    56  Wigan (England)    22</p>
<p> St Helens (England)	     30  Penrith (Australia) 50</p>
<p>(Corrects to make clear that Penrith is an Australian team) Played Saturday:</p>
<p> North Queensland (Australia)  44  Salford (England)   8</p>
